@model MatPaper.Services.TaskRunsPanel
@using MatPaper.Data
@inject MatPaper.Services.TaskTriggerQueue Queue
@{ var busy = Model.IsRunning || Queue.IsBusy(Model.Kind, Model.TaskId); }
@* The runs block at the top of a task editor. Not a nested form: render it OUTSIDE the editor's own <form>. While the newest run is still running
   the page asks for itself every few seconds and swaps in the parts marked data-live (matpaper.js). *@
<div class="mat-card" data-live="runs" @(busy ? Html.Raw("data-running=\"true\"") : null)>
    <div class="mat-card__head">
        <mp-icon name="clock" />
        <h2 class="mat-card__title">@L["Runs"]</h2>
        @if (Model.Memory is not null)
        {
            <span class="mat-muted">@Model.Memory</span>
        }
        <span class="mp-spacer"></span>
        @if (busy)
        {
            <form method="post" action="/System/TaskRuns/Cancel?kind=@((int)Model.Kind)&taskId=@Model.TaskId">
                @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                <mp-button variant="danger" size="sm" icon="stop">@L["Cancel run"]</mp-button>
            </form>
        }
        <form method="post" action="@Model.RunAction">
            @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
            <mp-button variant="primary" size="sm" icon="play" disabled="@busy">@(busy ? L["Running"].Value : Model.RunLabel)</mp-button>
        </form>
        @if (Model.ResetAction is not null)
        {
            <form method="post" action="@Model.ResetAction">
                @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                <mp-button variant="secondary" size="sm" icon="restore" confirm='@L["Forget where the task stopped? The next run checks everything again."]' confirm-ok='@L["Start over"]'>@L["Start over"]</mp-button>
            </form>
        }
    </div>

    @if (Model.Runs.Count == 0)
    {
        <div class="mat-card__body"><p class="mat-muted">@L["No run yet."]</p></div>
    }
    else
    {
        <mp-table item-count="Model.Runs.Count" table-class="mat-table--compact" caption='@L["Runs"]'>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">@L["Started"]</th>
                    <th scope="col">@L["State"]</th>
                    <th scope="col" class="mat-num">@L["Items"]</th>
                    <th scope="col" class="mat-num">@L["Duration"]</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @foreach (var r in Model.Runs)
                {
                    <tr>
                        <td><a href="/System/TaskRuns/Details?id=@r.Id">@Fmt.DateTime(r.StartedAt)</a></td>
                        <td>
                            @switch (r.State)
                            {
                                case TaskRunState.Success:
                                    <span class="mat-pill mat-pill--ok">@L["Success"]</span>
                                    break;
                                case TaskRunState.Failed:
                                    <span class="mat-pill mat-pill--error">@L["Failed"]</span>
                                    break;
                                case TaskRunState.Cancelled:
                                    <span class="mat-pill mat-pill--warn">@L["Cancelled"]</span>
                                    break;
                                default:
                                    <span class="mat-pill mat-pill--busy">@L["Running"]</span>
                                    break;
                            }
                        </td>
                        <td class="mat-num mat-mono">@r.ItemsProcessed</td>
                        <td class="mat-num mat-mono">
                            @if (r.FinishedAt is DateTime finished)
                            {
                                var d = finished - r.StartedAt;
                                @($"{(int)d.TotalHours:00}:{d.Minutes:00}:{d.Seconds:00}")
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <span>—</span>
                            }
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </mp-table>
        <div class="mat-card__foot"><a href="/System/TaskRuns?Kind=@Model.Kind.ToString().ToLowerInvariant()">@L["All runs"]</a></div>
    }
</div>
